---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="AI Prompt Builder" description="Build a clear, structured AI prompt from your goal, context, audience, constraints, and output format. Free, private, and entirely in your browser." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Free Tools',url:'/tools/'},{name:'AI Prompt Builder',url:'/tools/ai-prompt-builder/'}]}>
<header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow mint">/ tools / compose</p><h1>AI Prompt Builder</h1><p>Give your idea a little structure. This tool combines your inputs into a prompt; it does not call an AI model.</p></header>
<noscript><p>This tool needs JavaScript. You can also use the <a href="/prompts/a-practical-ai-prompt-framework/">written prompt framework</a>.</p></noscript>
<div class="tool-workspace"><form id="prompt-form" class="tool-form"><label for="goal">Your goal <span class="mint">(required)</span><textarea id="goal" name="goal" required maxlength="10000" rows="3" placeholder="Explain how to plan a small community event."></textarea></label><label for="context">Context<textarea id="context" name="context" rows="3" maxlength="20000" placeholder="A volunteer team of four, a two-week timeline, and a small budget."></textarea></label><label for="audience">Target audience<input id="audience" name="audience" maxlength="2000" placeholder="First-time event organizers" /></label><label for="constraints">Constraints<textarea id="constraints" name="constraints" rows="2" maxlength="10000" placeholder="Use plain English. Flag missing details. Do not invent costs."></textarea></label><label for="format">Preferred output format<input id="format" name="format" maxlength="2000" placeholder="A numbered plan with a short checklist" /></label><div class="tool-actions"><button class="primary" type="submit">Build my prompt →</button><button type="reset">Reset</button></div><p id="prompt-status" class="tool-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form>
<section class="tool-output" aria-labelledby="output-title"><h2 id="output-title">Your structured prompt</h2><label class="small muted" for="prompt-output">Review and edit before using it in your AI tool.</label><textarea id="prompt-output" readonly placeholder="Your prompt will appear here."></textarea><div class="tool-actions"><button id="copy-prompt" type="button" disabled>Copy</button><button id="download-prompt" type="button" disabled>Download TXT</button></div><p id="copy-status" role="status" class="tool-status"></p><p class="tool-footnote">Inputs stay on this page and are cleared when you reload or reset. Avoid including sensitive information. <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy details</a></p></section></div>
<section class="section prose info-content"><h2>Make the prompt your own</h2><p>Start with the result you need, then add only the context that changes the answer. Constraints work best when you can check them: “three options, each under 80 words” is more useful than “make it great.”</p><p>Try the <a href="/prompts/how-to-write-better-ai-prompts/">guide to better prompts</a> for examples. After you receive an answer, use the <a href="/tools/ai-response-checklist/">response checklist</a> to review it.</p></section>
<script>import '../../scripts/prompt-builder';</script>
</Base>
